        },
        {
          "text": "Ikindi, umugororotsi ni yahindukira akareka ubugororotsi bgiwe, agakora ivy’ ukugabitanya, nanje ngashira igitsitaza imbere yiwe, azopfa: kuk’ utāmubūriye, azopfira mu caha ciwe; kand’ ibikorwa vyiwe bigororotse yakoze ntazobiharūrwako, arikw amaraso yiwe nzoyakuronderako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
