              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamara ni wabūrira umugororotsi, uwo mugororotsi ngo yoye gukora icaha, na we ntagikore nyene, ntazobura kubaho, kuko yemeye kubūrirwa; kandi nawe uzoba urokoye ubugingo bgawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
